# CVE-2025-48924: Uncontrolled Recursion in Apache Commons Lang (commons-lang3)
# NVD states that commons-lang3 3.18.0+ is NOT affected.
# We use 3.20.0 (the latest release) which is the fixed version.
# Trivy's vulnerability database has an incorrect affected version range.
# Reference: https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-48924
CVE-2025-48924

# Base-image OS-package CVEs (libpng, libxml2, libexpat, p11-kit, …) are
# actively patched by `RUN apk upgrade --no-cache` in each service Dockerfile,
# so no OS-package suppressions are needed here.
